      "$2x = \\pm 120^\\circ + k \\cdot 360^\\circ$",
      "$x = \\pm 60^\\circ + k \\cdot 180^\\circ$, $k \\in \\mathbb{Z}$",
      "In $[0^\\circ; 180^\\circ]$: $x = 60^\\circ$ or $x = 120^\\circ$."
    ], "answer": "$x = \\pm 60^\\circ + k \\cdot 180^\\circ$; $x = 60^\\circ$ or $120^\\circ$" },
    { "type": "example", "title": "Worked example 5: a quadratic trig equation", "problem": "Solve $2\\sin^2 x - \\sin x - 1 = 0$ for $x \\in [0^\\circ; 360^\\circ]$.", "steps": [
